{"version":1,"content":"<p>一般人對傳統家庭主婦的印象，離不開「洗衫煮飯湊仔、清潔打掃一腳踢」。</p><p>對香港女性而言，今時今日，寧可返工賺錢請工人姐姐幫手，也不願做全職主婦，因為這份「工作」一點不輕鬆，全年365日無假放，超時亦無補「水」。</p><p>更重要的是，身份價值認同低，甚至會</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T04:12:03.470816+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T04:00:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T04:05:21.841459+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T04:05:21.841459+00:00","content_hash":"51028235e9ca277d501ce375ffc3623aee896d3a027763b08fba7f1904f858f1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}